## Next Steps for User

To enable analytics tracking on Vercel:
1. Navigate to your Vercel dashboard
2. Select your project
3. Click on "Analytics" in the sidebar
4. Click the "Enable" button
5. Deploy your application to Vercel
6. Verify tracking by checking the Network tab for requests to `/<unique-path>/view`

